{"timestamp":"2026-02-12T10:55:56.829921","level":"DEBUG","tag":"","message":"FlintDart CLI\n\nUsage: flint <command> [options]\n\nAvailable commands:\n  create              Creates a new Flint Dart project\n  start               Runs the development server\n  run                 Runs the development server\n  build               Builds the application for production\n  make:docker         Creates Docker configuration for the project\n  deploy-globe        Prepare Globe deployment files (globe.yaml, optional swagger-ui assets)\n  migrate             Runs database migrations\n  db:create           Creates database from .env or name\n  db:user:create      Creates DB user and grants DB privileges\n  db:export           Exports database dump using mysqldump/pg_dump\n  make:model          Creates a new model class\n  make:controller       Creates a new controller class\n  make:middleware     Creates a new middleware class\n  make:isolate        Create a new isolate task\n  docs:generate       Generate Swagger docs from routes\n  make:seeder         Create a new standalone database seeder\n  seed                Run database seeders\n  make:mail           Create a new HTML-based Flint mail class and template.\n  update              Updates Flint Dart-related dependencies only\n  upgrade             Upgrades Flint Dart CLI and project dependencies\n  version             Shows the current Flint Dart CLI version\n  make:resource         Creates controller, routes and registers them\n  route                 Creates a new RouteGroup\n  --v                 Shows the current Flint Dart CLI version\n","error":null,"stack":null}
